    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d725">

                <pb facs="0760" n="756" xml:id="pg756"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/6901: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bullitt</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-06-02T19:00:00-04:00">June 2, 1939—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>396. Your 1051, June 1, 6 p.m., last paragraph. The Department desires that,
                    unless you perceive objection, you strongly urge the appropriate French
                    authorities to facilitate by all reasonable methods the transit of the tung oil
                    shipments, basing your approach on (<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>) the need of
                    the American paint industry for the tung oil, (<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>)
                    the fact that the shipments of tung oil are the means for repayment for the
                    $25,000,000 credit extended by the Export-Import Bank,<anchor n="64"
                        xml:id="d725-f1"/> and (<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>) the fact that
                    delivery of the tung oil will operate toward maintaining China’s credit which in
                    turn is to the interest of all countries desirous of maintaining normal and
                    healthy relations with China.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d725-f1" n="64" xml:id="d725-f1-content">
